  "subtitle": "Nigerian steamed black-eyed bean pudding",
  "excerpt": "Moin moin is a smooth, savoury bean pudding made from blended black-eyed beans, peppers and onion, then steamed until set. It is eaten as a side dish or a light meal on its own. Serves 4.",
